OL,3,AThe #70 refund letter that isn't a scam
OL,4,
OL,5,FYou may be among the one million
OL,6,Fpeople, mostly women, who will receive
OL,7,Fletters explaining how you are eligible
OL,8,Ffor top-up payments - and it's not a
OL,9,Fscam.
OL,11,FThose entitled are low earners who have
OL,12,Fmissed out on the money because of the
OL,13,Fway the pension they pay into is
OL,14,Fadministered.
OL,16,FHM Revenue and Customs (HMRC) will
OL,17,Fwrite to people over the next few
OL,18,Fmonths, explaining how to receive the
OL,19,Fpayment. Typically they will be due
OL,20,F#70, but that may vary considerably
OL,21,Fdepending on their circumstances.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
