OL,3,AThe #70 refund letter that isn't a scam
OL,4,
OL,5,FAnyone eligible - the vast majority of
OL,6,Fwhom will be of working age rather than
OL,7,Fpensioners - will be contacted
OL,8,Fautomatically. But, if you receive a
OL,9,Fletter, there are various checks you
OL,10,Fcan do to ensure the letter is genuine
OL,11,Fso you don't get hoodwinked.
